Hello Principal<br />
&nbsp;<br />
With the school year coming to a close and next year&rsquo;s planning already taking place I would like to explore the opportunity of the Red Cross being part of that planning with our Scholarship program.&nbsp; The program works if the school hosts two blood drives during the 18-19 school year, and then based on amount of units collected the Red Cross will award scholarship monies toward your school for a student of your choice.&nbsp; This is a great project for student groups, as the planning, running and donating promotes a teamwork atmosphere as well as an opportunity to earn community service hours for those that are looking to obtain them.&nbsp; We are currently working with schools for the 18-19 school year and would like to see about working with you as well.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
